  data: {
    LLM: "Protect your Queen of Clubs! It is the only invincible card in the game. Use it to capture a Ten or Ace early.\n\nThe Power of the Seven: Because the 7 of trumps is the second highest card, it can 'trap' every other Queen (except Clubs) and all the Jacks. Do not waste the 7 on a small trick.\n\nDefensive Lead: If your partnership is in the lead and you hold the QC, lead a small card of an off-suit to see if your partner can trump in. If the opponent trumps, you can 'over-trump' with the QC.",
    Player: "Protect your Queen of Clubs! It is the only invincible card in the game. Use it to capture a Ten or Ace early.\n\nThe Power of the Seven: Because the 7 of trumps is the second highest card, it can 'trap' every other Queen (except Clubs) and all the Jacks. Do not waste the 7 on a small trick.\n\nDefensive Lead: If your partnership is in the lead and you hold the QC, lead a small card of an off-suit to see if your partner can trump in. If the opponent trumps, you can 'over-trump' with the QC.",
